idden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.5293 10.5884L17.6469 10.5884" stroke="#7C7B7B" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M10.5884 3.5293L10.5884 17.6469" stroke="#7C7B7B" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer-item md" id="faq_answer_What is monday work management? " role="region" aria-labelledby="faq_question_What is monday work management? " tabindex="0">Built on top of monday.com Work OS, monday work management enables organizations, managers, and executives to reach shared goals faster and collaboratively at scale. From setting goals to navigating projects and everyday work, monday work management can help you streamline it all. Using powerful features such as automations and dashboards, teams and departments can easily adjust and customize any workflow for any business need.</div></li><li class="faq-list-item"><div class="faq-question css-1nk4q7q e1pb4cs70" aria-expanded="false" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-controls="faq_answer_Does monday.com have a free version?"><div class="faq-question-item"><div class="faq-question-text xs" id="faq_question_Does monday.com have a free version?">Does monday.com have a free version?</div><div class="down-arrow-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.5293 10.5884L17.6469 10.5884" stroke="#7C7B7B" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M10.5884 3.5293L10.5884 17.6469" stroke="#7C7B7B" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer-item md" id="faq_answer_Does monday.com have a free version?" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq_question_Does monday.com have a free version?" tabindex="0">monday.com has a free plan which is ideal for freelancers and individual professionals. In addition, we offer a 14-day free trial for the Pro plan.</div></li><li class="faq-list-item"><div class="faq-question css-1nk4q7q e1pb4cs70" aria-expanded="false" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-controls="faq_answer_Is monday.com HIPPAA compliant?"><div class="faq-question-item"><div class="faq-question-text xs" id="faq_question_Is monday.com HIPPAA compliant?">Is monday.com HIPPAA compliant?</div><div class="down-arrow-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 22 22" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.5293 10.5884L17.6469 10.5884" stroke="#7C7B7B" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M10.5884 3.5293L10.5884 17.6469" stroke="#7C7B7B" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></div></div></div><div class="faq-answer-item md" id="faq_answer_Is monday.com HIPPAA compliant?" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq_question_Is monday.com HIPPAA compliant?" tabindex="0">Yes, monday.com complies with the Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act (HIPAA).</div></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class="base-layout-segment-component base-layout-segment-component-13 css-1ko1fwa em86ut10" style="padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:64px"><div class="segment-wrapper"><style data-emotion="css nph0m7">.css-nph0m7{max-width:1440px;margin:auto;}.css-nph0m7 .full-with-bullets-paragraph-wrapper{margin:auto;display:-webkit-box;display:-webkit-flex;display:-ms-flexbox;display:flex;-webkit-box-pack:center;-ms-flex-pack:center;-webkit-justify-content:center;justify-content:center;padding:0px 32px;}</style><div class="full-with-bullets-paragraph-component css-nph0m7 e13u5b230"><div class="full-with-bullets-paragraph-wrapper" style="max-width:1100px"><div class="full-paragraph align-items-left css-1yu2fk9 eqrtdhw0" style="text-align:left"><div class="paragraph-body-wrapper"><div class="paragraph-wrapper css-y9sbll esddhkv0"><div class="jsx-d5ab030c0026806b monday-markup-language