pricingPage.enterprise.aiBundle.tooltip.vibe":"Build secure, custom business software in minutes, in the context of work","pricingPage.enterprise.aiBundle.tooltip.sidekick":"An intelligent, context-aware AI assistant that understands, connects, and runs your work.","pricingPage.enterprise.aiBundle.tooltip.ai-credits":"Run AI powered features that streamline your work.","pricingPage.enterprise.topTierSupport.heading":"Top tier support","pricingPage.plans.student.title":"Student","pricingPage.plans.npo.title":"Nonprofit","pricingPage.freeForDurationOfStudies":"Free for the duration of your studies","pricingPage.plans.npo.discount":"70% discount","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.student":"For students looking to keep track of their tasks and work.","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.individual.new":"For individuals looking to keep track of their work","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.individual.new.name_free":"For small teams looking to keep track of their work","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.basic.new":"Manage all your teams’ work in one place","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.standard.new":"Collaborate and optimize your team processes","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.pro.new":"Streamline and run your teams’ complex workflows","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.enterprise.new":"For organizations seeking enterprise-grade features","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.crm.free":"Organize your contacts, sales pipelines, and marketing for small businesses– recommended for 3 users.","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.crm.basic":"Organize your contacts, sales pipelines, and marketing for small businesses– recommended for 3 users.","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.crm.standard":"Track your contacts, pipelines, and projects with visualization tools and automations.","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.crm.pro":"A complete CRM platform to manage your sales cycle from A-Z with powerful tools and automations.","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.crm.enterprise":"Enterprise-grade business workflows and CRM capabilities combined with unlimited enterprise support.","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.marketing.basic":"Organize your marketing workflows, requests and activities for small businesses","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.marketing.standard":"Track online campaigns, creative requests, and projects with visualizations and automations","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.marketing.pro":"A complete marketing platform to manage your marketing and creative processes from A-Z with powerful tools, visualizations and automations","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.marketing.enterprise":"Enterprise-grade business workflows and marketing capabilities combined with unlimited enterprise support","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.pmo.basic":"Manage team tasks and simple projects.","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.pmo.standard":"Plan and track projects and tasks with visualization tools and automations.","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.pmo.pro":"Manage projects and processes from A-Z with powerful analytical tools and automations.","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.pmo.enterprise":"Enterprise-grade business workflows and analytics combined with unlimited enterprise support.","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.npo.pro":"For nonprofits that need to manage their operations, projects, volunteers, and donors from A to Z. Your first 10 seats are free.","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.npo.enterprise":"For nonprofit organizations that need enterprise-grade security, control, and support.","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.dev.basic":"Organize your roadmap and development tasks in one place","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.dev.standard":"Visualize and track your roadmap, releases and iterations from planning till execution","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.dev.pro":"Manage product development from A-Z with powerful analytical tools, automations, and integrations","pricingPage.tierDescriptions.dev.enterprise":"Enterprise-grade business workflows and analytics combined with unlimied enterprise support.","pricingPage.features.sections.essentials":"Essentia