gement","pricingPage.features.titles.advancedPermissions":"Advanced permissions","pricingPage.features.titles.workflowAndApprovalAutomation":"Workflow and approval automation","pricingPage.features.titles.advancedReports":"Advanced reports \u003cbr\u003e (Dashboards with up to 20 boards)","pricingPage.features.titles.filesManagement":"Files management","pricingPage.features.titles.leadAssignment":"Lead assignment","pricingPage.features.titles.customizableSalesProcess":"Fully customizable sales process","pricingPage.features.titles.customerProjectManagement":"Customer project management","pricingPage.features.titles.webToLeadCapturing":"Web-to-lead capturing","pricingPage.features.titles.customDashboards":"Fully customized dashboards","pricingPage.features.titles.twoWayEmailSync":"2-way Email sync","pricingPage.features.titles.commissionManagement":"Commission management","pricingPage.features.titles.advancedCustomerProjectManagement":"Advanced customer project management","pricingPage.features.titles.high_level_marketing_planning":"High level marketing planning","pricingPage.features.titles.adobe_creative_cloud_plugin":"Adobe Creative cloud plugin","pricingPage.features.titles.unlimitedProjectsItemsSubitems":"Unlimited projects, items and subitems","pricingPage.features.titles.unlimitedShareableForms":"Unlimited shareable forms","pricingPage.features.titles.fileManagement":"File management","pricingPage.features.titles.ganttCharts":"Gantt charts","pricingPage.features.titles.customNotificationsAndReminders":"Custom notifications \u0026 reminders","pricingPage.features.titles.projectPortfolioManagement":"Simple project portfolio management","pricingPage.features.titles.calendarSync":"Calendar sync (Google \u0026 Outlook)","pricingPage.features.titles.basicAnalytics":"Basic analytics \u0026 reporting dashboards","pricingPage.features.titles.taskAndProjectDependencies":"Task \u0026 project dependencies","pricingPage.features.titles.milestonesManagement":"Milestones management","pricingPage.features.titles.resourceAllocation":"Resource allocation \u0026 management","pricingPage.features.titles.powerfulAnalytics":"Powerful reporting \u0026 analytics dashboards","pricingPage.features.titles.unlimitedPrivateBoards":"Unlimited private boards","pricingPage.features.titles.advancedFormulaCapabilities":"Advanced formula capabilities","pricingPage.features.titles.slackMSTeamsTodoistIntegrations":"Integrate Slack, Microsoft Teams and Todoist","pricingPage.features.titles.advancedProjectPortfolioManagement":"Advanced project portfolio management","pricingPage.features.titles.enterpriseIntegrations":"Advanced integrations with Jira server, Salesforce and more","pricingPage.features.titles.teams_inside_teams":"Teams inside teams","pricingPage.features.titles.custom_roles":"Custom roles","pricingPage.features.titles.seats_management":"Seats management","pricingPage.features.titles.tenant_restrictions":"Tenant level restrictions","pricingPage.features.titles.approved_guest":"Approved guest domain","pricingPage.features.titles.block_domains":"Block domains from signup","pricingPage.features.descriptions.filters":"Filter items that are relevant to you right now, and save those filters as Views, to quickly get back to them later.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.timelineAndCalendarView":"Manage people and their workloads in a totally visual way, and view your information on a calendar.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.timelineAndGanttView":"See all upcoming work in a visual timeline, and use Gantt charts to ensure you’re meeting deadlines successfully.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.boardPermissions":"Control what information can be edited at the board level.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.enterpriseScaleAutomations":"Includes 250,000 automation and integration actions per month.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.enterpriseSpecifciIntegrations":"Integrate with Salesforce and Jira Server.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.enterpriseGradeSecurity":"Top tier security features \u0026 user management controls.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.multiLevelPermissions":"Robust permissions at every level to give you full control.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.advancedReporting":"Slice and dice everything and get actionable insights from the data.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.premiumSupport":"24/7 quality support with a priority queue included.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.fiftyDashboards":"Bigger dashboards that can pull high level insights from up to 50 boards per dashboard.","pricingPage.tierCards.learnMoreButton":"Watch why %param1%","pricingPage.tierCards.buttonLabel":"Video button","pricingPage.tierCards.planIncludes":"%param1% includes: ","pricingPage.tierCards.planIncludes.withLineDrop":"%param1% plan \u003cbr\u003e includes:","pricingPage.tierCards.includesPlanPlus":"Includes %param1%, plus:","pricingPage.tierCards.includesPlanPlus.withLineDrop":"Includes %param1%, \u003cbr\u003e plus:","pricingPage.tierCards.ourAbsoluteBestSupport":"Our absolute best support","pricingPage.features.descriptions.communication_with_context":"Tag and update team members within the context of your work.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.integrations_with_gmail_and_outlook":"Turn your emails from clients \u0026 team members into action by integrating your email.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.embed_documents_and_briefs":"Share, upload \u0026 embed all file types including briefs into monday.com.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.marketing_requests_with_forms":"Standardize content or creative requests. Use forms to centralize everything in one place.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.ready_made_marketing_templates":"Get a quick \u0026 easy start with our templates such as marketing requests or strategic high level planning. ","pricingPage.features.descriptions.deadline_management":"Set due or overdue reminders for you and your team so you never miss a deadline.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.marketing_integrations":"Integrate apps like Facebook, Mailchimp or SurveyMonkey and more to move the data you need to and from monday.com.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.marketing_dashboards":"See where things stand at a glance. Get custom overviews of budgets, projects, and strategic planning.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.marketing_calendar":"Create \u0026 manage your marketing calendar. Filter \u0026 sort by team, publish dates, or status to see what’s important.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.daily_reports":"Get a quick summary of what’s been done, where things stand and what needs to get done. ","pricingPage.features.descriptions.import_export_excel":"Import from existing tools like Excel, Trello or Asana to start working seamlessly. Export almost anything and everything in monday.com for your additional needs.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.items":"Within boards we have rows, or 'Items' - An Item can be anything you want it to be - Task, project, customer, etc. Each free account starts with %param1% free Items. You can get more Items by referring friends to create their own accounts.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.unlimitedItems":"Within boards we have rows, or 'Items' - An Item can be anything you want it to be - Task, project, customer, etc. Use as many items as you want throughout your different boards to manage all kinds of information!","pricingPage.features.descriptions.prioritisedCustomerSupport":"Enjoy all the benefits of our unmatched support team.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.upToXMembers":"Collaborate in teams of up to %param1% members.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.seats":"The number of seats / team members in your account.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.columns":"Columns are one of the fundamental building blocks of your board. Customise your teams’ boards by using columns.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.viewers":"Viewers have read only access to the data within the account with no editing rights.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.boards":"Boards are the place for organizing all your work and data (e.g. projects, clients, processes).","pricingPage.features.descriptions.docs":"Create docs and collaborate with your team in real time. As your collaboration thrives, turn those words into actions with live updated data using monday.com Real Time Engine!","pricingPage.features.descriptions.columnTypes":"Build your board the way you want with our variety of column types.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.mobile":"Stay connected on-the-go and access monday.com from your smart phone.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.kanbanView":"Manage work using a Kanban view to assign and prioritize tasks according to your team's capacity.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.forms":"Create and customize a form directly from your monday.com board and share it anywhere.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.storage":"More storage means more space to save files, images, and important documents.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.activityLog":"Track all changes to your work and see who changed what and when.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.automations":"Automate repetitive work by setting customizable actions in your boards.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.premiumIntegrations":"Connect monday.com with SalesForce or your ERP such as NetSuite.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.integrations":"Connect monday.com with the tools you already use to have all your team’s work in one place.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.dashboards":"Gain data-driven insights about your work by visualizing your data in different ways.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.aiCredits":"Run AI powered features that streamline your work","pricingPage.features.descriptions.guests":"Collaborate on specific projects with your outside users without giving them access to your full account.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.zoom_integration":"Create and join Zoom meetings with other team members directly from your monday.com boards.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.timeline":"Plan and track time-sensitive tasks and projects with your team.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.calendar":"Manage all your upcoming work using a visual calendar.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.templates":"Choose from over 200+ templates for every industry, and customize them to fit your team's needs.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.importFromOtherTools":"Import your work from other tools and gather all your team's projects and tasks in one place.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.updatesSection":"Communicate with your team, share files and documents, and stay-up-to-date in real-time.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.customizableNotifications":"Stay on top of your work at all times with customizable notifications to fit your exact needs.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.webinars":"Join one of our daily webinars - there’s always something new to discover and ways to improve!","pricingPage.features.descriptions.maximumSeats":"The maximum number of people per account.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.boardAdministrators":"Administrators can control who can edit and create content on selected boards.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.campaign_management":"Manage incoming campaign requests, approvals, tracking and more.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.high_level_marketing_planning":"Plan the best marketing strategies for the year and the steps needed for execution. Align each strategy with its mission, audience, budget and more.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.ip_restrictions":"IP restrictions: Limit account access to specific IP addresses, like users joining from a specific location (ex. from the office) or using a VPN.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.content_directory":"The Content Directory lets admins view a list of all content in their account in one place - all boards, dashboards, docs and workspaces.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.map":"View any geographic locations on an interactive map.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.whiteboard":"Brainstorm, edit, and create together on this shared collaborative whiteboard.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.embed_docs":"Collaborate on shared docs directly from within monday.com","pricingPage.features.descriptions.search":"Search everything in your entire account, including images, posts, updates, mentions and projects.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.formsCustomization":"Make forms your own by adding your company logo and a background color of your choice.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.email":"Send emails to automatically post an update in monday.com and get instant email notifications when someone mentions you.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.externalIntegration":"Connect monday.com with your other apps and services, like Dropbox, Google Drive, and more.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.workload":"See who is over capacity and allocate upcoming tasks and resources accordingly.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.timeTracking":"Track and monitor the time spent on each task.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.chartView":"Visualize your data on different types of charts and graphs.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.formula":"Create formulas to perform data calculations on your monday.com boards.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.dependencyColumn":"Dependency columns ensure a consistent relationship between items - for example: one item can only start after the other is complete.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.tags":"Tags work like keywords or labels that make it easy to organize your to-dos, tasks, and projects across your account.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.privateBoards":"Private boards/docs are only visible and accessible to you and team members you invite.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.twoFa":"According to security standards, when someone logs in from an unfamiliar device, they’ll need to confirm an access code.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.soc":"The SOC 2 Report demonstrates monday.com’s commitment to meeting the most rigorous security, availability and confidentiality standards.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.google":"Log in with your team’s Google Apps account. No need to store any new passwords in your brain.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.saml":"Log in with your SAML account (Okta, OneLogin, Azure AD or custom) - No need to memorize passwords.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.scimProvisioning":"Sync automatically with your user identity provider - no need to add/remove users manually.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.auditLog":"See who logged in, when, and from which IP address.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.sessions":"View all user session's data and reset any session from the admin panel.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.panicMode":"Lock down your whole account if your team's credentials have been compromised.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.hipaa":"monday.com complies with the Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act (HIPAA).","pricingPage.features.descriptions.sla":"We provide a 99.9% uptime in our Service-Level Agreement.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.salesforceIntegration":"Salesforce is a sales process management tool that helps you to track leads and manage your sales process from start to finish.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.integrationPermissions":"Control the access to specific integrations for enhanced security.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.privateWorkspaces":"Manage and control which users can access your workspaces.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.accountPermissions":"Set who can use features across your account.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.knowledgeBase":"Explore tutorials, guides, and articles on anything you need about monday.com.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.emailSupport":"Receive unmatched support from our customer success team available anytime, anywhere.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.training":"In-depth training for every member of your team to help you get the most out of monday.com.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.csManager":"Receive tailored onboarding, extensive training hours, and continued personalized support. *Provided that customers meet the minimum spend threshold as applicable from time to time.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.workPerformanceInsights":"Visualize and understand the performance of your projects and workflows so you know what’s working and what’s not.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.dashboardEmailNotifications":"Get automatic dashboard reports directly to your email inbox.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.pivotAnalysis":"Slice and dice your board data with pivot table analysis \u0026 visualization.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.adobe_creative_cloud_plugin":"Plan the best marketing strategies for the year and the steps needed for execution. Align each strategy with its mission, audience, budget and more.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.leadManagement":"Manage your leads, contacts and deals with ready-made templates and powerful capabilities.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.unlimitedPipelines":"Build unlimited sales pipelines. Choose from dozens of templates based on industry or customize your own.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.unlimitedContacts":"monday.com offers unlimited space to store your sales contacts.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.unlimitedCustomFields":"Capture data points quickly with unlimited custom fields. Create custom workflows, sales pipelines, and projects.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.fullMobileCRM":"Stay connected on-the-go and access all your information, securely, from your smart phone.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.documentManagement":"Manage your sales and customer documents securely.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.apiAccess":"Need more capabilities? Use monday.com's robust, open API to create custom apps, send information, and much more.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.emailIntegration":"Integrate your Outlook or Gmail account in a few clicks. Easily set up automations to send and receive email.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.salesAnalytics":"See all your sales data at a glance using customizable reports with dashboards, including special board views.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.mailchimpIntegration":"Integrate mailchimp and instantly update your mailing lists. Analyze statistics about campaign performance right inside your boards! Manage your campaigns from one place, sync leads and subscribers, get notifications and stats on sent campaigns.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.salesGoals":"Set goals within the board or dashboard levels. Aggregate data and use widgets to tailor your reports and forecast business and operational performance.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.customizedNotifications":"Send and receive custom notifications with powerful automations. No need for deep technical knowledge or coding - set up automations in a few clicks in our automations center.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.marketingActivityManagement":"Manage your marketing activities with a ready-made templates with powerful capabilities built in.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.workflowAndApprovalAutomation":"Build workflows with advanced approval automations.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.filesManagement":"Manage your sales and customer documents securely.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.leadAssignment":"Assign leads easily, communicate with your team, and allocate work.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.customizableSalesProcess":"Fully tailor your sales processes with unlimited columns and powerful, customizable board features.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.customerProjectManagement":"Use ready-made templates and manage any type of project confidently.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.webToLeadCapturing":"Embed and send customized, web-based lead forms; responses automatically collected into boards.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.customDashboards":"Customize beautiful, visual, and exportable dashboards with dozens of widgets.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.twoWayEmailSync":"Integrate your Outlook or Gmail account in a few clicks. Easily set up automations to send and receive emails.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.commissionManagement":"Manage commissions with calculation templates.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.advancedCustomerProjectManagement":"Manage any type of project, even the most complex, with over 200 ready-made templates.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.unlimitedProjectsItemsSubitems":"Manage projects on unlimited boards where you can create as many tasks and sub tasks as you need.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.unlimitedShareableForms":"Create forms, and easily share them online or within your organization.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.shareableForms.plusBranded":"plus custom branded forms","pricingPage.features.descriptions.portfolios.20":"20","pricingPage.features.descriptions.portfolios.unlimited":"Unlimited","pricingPage.features.descriptions.shareableForms.plusConditional":"plus custom conditional logic forms","pricingPage.features.descriptions.fileManagement":"Store and manage files and documents.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.ganttCharts":"Visualise the different stages of your projects, track your progress and make smarter decisions.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.customNotificationsAndReminders":"Create notifications and set reminders with full customization - decide exactly when, what and who will get them.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.projectPortfolioManagement":"Manage your projects within boards, folders and workspaces with useful templates and visualisation tools.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.calendarSync":"Sync your existing calendars on Google or Outlook with your monday.com calendar","pricingPage.features.descriptions.basicAnalytics":"Create reports from up to 5 projects, use analytical tools and make data driven decisions.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.taskAndProjectDependencies":"Set dependencies between tasks, and easily view and track them on top of the Gantt chart.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.milestonesManagement":"Create project milestones, view them on the Gantt chart and track progress.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.resourceAllocation":"Manage resources and allocate work across team members in an efficient way.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.powerfulAnalytics":"Create reports from up to 20 projects, use powerful visualsion tools and analyse your data.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.slackMSTeamsTodoistIntegrations":"Enjoy special integrations with Slack, Microsoft Teams and Todoist, and take your work collaboration to the next level.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.advancedProjectPortfolioManagement":"Manage your projects within folders and workspaces with advanced analitical tools like charts, time tracking and formulas.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.enterpriseIntegrations":"Special integrations only available for the Enterprise plan.","pricingPage.features.descriptions.teams_inside_teams":"Build a hierarchy of teams that reflects your company structure","pricingPage.features.descriptions.custom_roles":"Allow admins to create custom roles with custom permissions","pricingPage.features.descriptions.seats_management":"Assign each user to their specific department","pricingPage.features.descriptions.tenant_restrictions":"Restrict access to specific monday accounts on your network","pricingPage.features.descriptions.approved_guest":"Allow users to invite guests only from specific email domains","pricingPage.features.descriptions.block_domains":"Prevent your employees from creating additional monday accounts with your company domain","pricingPage.mobile.features.titles.items":"Up to 1000 Items","pricingPage.mobile.features.t